#Протокол_Rebuild_Verification_Loop<[
Базис:
  Work Graph rebuild требует автоматической проверки formatter, runtime, trace links, UI и OneBase golden path без смешения deterministic CI и optional real LLM сценариев.
  protocols/evidence-model-v1.bvc уже задаёт Evidence Record v1 и status gates; operator dashboard должен показывать результаты проверок оператору.
Вектор:
  Зафиксировать verification matrix с tier A deterministic (npm test, formatter roundtrip, runtime policy, trace validator, UI smoke) и tier B optional (OneBase go test, real LLM golden path).
  Описать evidence policy: WorkItem Свидетельства хранит human-readable строку; structured evidence projection живёт в dashboard/verification snapshot; done требует non-empty evidence per WorkItem v1 policy.
  Operator UI показывает matrix status, recent evidence feed и OneBase environment gate без ручного graph editor.
Цель:
  Рабочий контур проверяется автоматически и вручную понятен оператору.

Проверки:
  deterministic tests отделены от real LLM tests
  evidence policy совместима с WorkItem v1
  operator dashboard показывает результаты проверок

Метки:
  atom.profile: architecture_decision
  protocol.id: rebuild-verification-loop
  work.source: rebuild-verification-loop
  trace.status: verified
]>

#Tier_A_Deterministic_Tests<[
Базис:
  CI и локальный gate rebuild должны быть стабильными без внешней сети и без качества LLM.
Вектор:
  npm run test:deterministic -> node --test tests/*.test.mjs — единый deterministic suite для formatter, Work Graph runtime, trace links, architecture/schematic UI hooks, intent migration parity.
  Formatter roundtrip: tests/stepAtomFormatter paths inside deterministic suite; gate task implement-step-atom-formatter.
  Runtime policy: tests/workGraphRuntime.test.mjs covers claimNext, transitionStatus, dashboard snapshot; gate task implement-workgraph-minimal-runtime.
  Trace Links v1: tests/workGraphRuntime.test.mjs validator section; gate task implement-step-code-trace-link-validator.
  UI server: tests/workGraphBacklogUiServer.test.mjs + createBacklogUiServer HTTP smoke; gate tasks operator dashboard / architecture / schematic views.
  Deterministic suite не вызывает OpenAI/Ollama, не требует go в PATH и не меняет ../onebase.
Цель:
  Tier A даёт rebuild acceptance без model variance.

Метки:
  atom.profile: prompt_rule
  rule.id: verification-tier-a-deterministic
  protocol.id: rebuild-verification-loop
  trace.status: verified
]>

#Tier_B_Optional_Tests<[
Базис:
  OneBase golden path и real LLM сценарии полезны, но не должны блокировать deterministic CI или маскировать environment blockers.
Вектор:
  npm run test:optional:onebase -> scripts/run-onebase-verification.mjs: preflight go version, then go test ./... from ../onebase or record blocked environment evidence per domains/onebase/verification-command.bvc.
  npm run test:optional:onebase-check -> scripts/run-onebase-config-check.mjs: onebase check --project ../onebase/examples/trade; exit 0 skipped when CLI subcommand unavailable (graceful on older onebase builds).
  Optional real LLM scenario (future): agent discovers OneBase YAML/.os artifacts and proposes WorkItem changes; measured separately from Tier A; never required for npm run test:deterministic.
  Optional LLM tests записывают worker-run evidence и не переводят task в done без Tier A + domain verification evidence where applicable.
Цель:
  Environment and model quality risks stay visible without collapsing into one gate.

Метки:
  atom.profile: prompt_rule
  rule.id: verification-tier-b-optional
  protocol.id: rebuild-verification-loop
  trace.status: verified
]>

#Evidence_Recording_In_WorkGraph<[
Базис:
  Verification loop must remain compatible with WorkItem v1 string evidence today while allowing structured dashboard projection.
Вектор:
  Authoring: Свидетельства section lines remain human-readable; include command, exit_code, cwd, summary and artifact refs where applicable (see domains/onebase/verification-command.bvc Evidence_Format).
  Runtime transitionStatus: done requires non-empty evidence array; blocked requires blocker reason; verify may require proposed verification command in next_action or evidence summary.
  Dashboard projection: buildRecentEvidence maps legacy evidence strings to feed rows; buildVerificationSummary adds matrix row status from done WorkItems and evidence keyword heuristics (npm test, go test, blocked, exit_code).
  Future structuredEvidence array in workgraph.snapshot.v1 remains optional; verification loop must not require migration away from string evidence for MVP.
Цель:
  Operators and agents record proof in .bvc canon; UI explains gate state without parsing chat transcripts.

Метки:
  atom.profile: trace
  contract.id: verification-evidence-recording-v1
  protocol.id: rebuild-verification-loop
  trace.status: verified
]>

#Operator_Dashboard_Verification_Surface<[
Базис:
  Operator must see verification state beside task board without opening raw backlog.bvc.
Вектор:
  /api/dashboard-snapshot returns operator-dashboard.snapshot.v1 plus verification summary: tier counts, matrix rows, recent evidence, OneBase gate status.
  UI verification panel shows Tier A/B badges, matrix table, recent evidence list and link to blocked OneBase tasks when go is missing.
  Panel is readonly; state changes only through Work Graph transitions and recorded evidence, not through dashboard edits.
Цель:
  Verification loop is observable in the same operator surface as board/backlog/architecture/schematic views.

Метки:
  atom.profile: prompt_rule
  rule.id: operator-dashboard-verification-surface
  protocol.id: rebuild-verification-loop
  trace.status: verified
]>
